'''Dukie''' is an enemy added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]''. It floats diagonally around the room, occasionally spitting out 1-2 {{E|Dart Fly|text=Dart Flies}}. Dukies do not attack in any other way but can still do contact damage.

== Notes ==
* If there are 6 {{E|Dart Fly|text=Dart Flies}} spawned, Dukies will stop spawning Dart Flies.

