== Trivia ==
* Dukies were inspired by a [https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=tpPcp17z9Pg video by LeatherIceCream about a miniature Duke Of Flies].
* {{E|The Duke of Flies}} is the boss version of these enemies.
** Despite the fact that the Duke of Flies is a boss found in Chapter 1, Dukies themselves only begin to appear from Chapter 2 onward, or Chapter 1.5 in the alternate path.

